<section class="card">
  <h2>Set up AEGIS PDNS</h2>
  <p class="subtitle">
    Choose where you want protection:
  </p>
  <ul class="list">
    <li>One device: use Android Private DNS, iOS profile, or browser DoH.</li>
    <li>Whole network: configure your router or gateway.</li>
    <li>Organization: contact SecretChip for managed rollout planning.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Use the verification section after setup to confirm resolver behavior.</p>

  <div class="note">
    <div class="mini" style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Endpoints (copy any):</div>
    <div class="mono">DoH: {{ site.endpoints.doh }}</div>
    <div class="mono">DoT host: {{ site.endpoints.dotHost }} (port {{ site.endpoints.dotPort }})</div>
    <div class="mono">DoQ host: {{ site.endpoints.doqHost }} (port {{ site.endpoints.doqPort }})</div>
    <div class="mono">Block test host: {{ site.endpoints.blockTestHost }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="btnrow">
